  "label": "Display of knives symbolizing violence in a divisive context",
  "description": "The scene centers on a pile of metallic knives with sharp blades and black handles, arranged in a disorganized heap. The knives are in sharp focus in the foreground, symbolizing imminent danger and violence. The visual composition is juxtaposed with overlaid text promoting a hateful, divisive narrative about religion-based riots, creating a scene that links physical violence with systemic injustice and scapegoating. The knives are the primary visual material entity, and their arrangement and focus emphasize their role as symbols of aggression.",
